      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Elevate your everyday care routine with Eclipse Plus Mints, available in two delightful flavors: Honey Lemon and Loquat Pear. These sugar-free mints are thoughtfully crafted using a blend of traditional herbs like luohanguo, honeysuckle, and chrysanthemum, known for their beneficial throat-soothing properties. Each flavor offers a unique and refreshing experience, perfect for maintaining fresh breath and a comfortable throat throughout the day.\n\n-Traditional Herb Blend: Infused with luohanguo, honeysuckle, and chrysanthemum, which are well-regarded for their throat care benefits.\n-Flavor Options: Choose between Honey Lemon, with its sweet and sour notes, or Loquat Pear, featuring a unique and refreshing fruit blend.\n-Soothing Mint: Each mint provides a comforting, mouth-watering taste that cools and soothes the throat.\n-Sugar-Free: Enjoy long-lasting freshness without the sugar, making these mints a healthier choice.\n\nExperience the dual benefits of refreshing breath and throat comfort with Eclipse Plus Mints in Honey Lemon and Loquat Pear flavors. Perfect for daily use, these mints are your go-to solution for everyday voice and throat care.",
